    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont know... it felt way more intentional than just a tic. like the skin around the eye didn't even move right. and she's been acting so different lately too, like her whole vibe is just \"off.\" if it's not a medical thing, do u think it could be some kind of advanced deepfake or digital overlay used in real time? like for a live broadcast?",
