      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "In sophisticated digital manipulations, you would look for inconsistencies in lighting, shadows, and reflections across the face, as these are hard to AI-perfect. Another major tell is unnatural frequency in blinking patterns or inconsistencies in how subtle facial muscle movements map onto the underlying video frame. Significant differences in skin texture consistency between various close-ups, or unnatural motion parallax, are strong indicators of synthetic generation.",
